  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chicken breast and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic granules, bhuna curry powder, and salt, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the uncooked white rice and cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the chicken broth and lemon juice, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove from heat and let rest for 5 minutes before serving."
